{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T16:00:05+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T16:00:05+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Altri, SGPS, S.A.","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Paper & Paper Products","country":"Portugal","city":"Porto","website":"https://altri.pt","employees":835,"summary":"Altri, SGPS, S.A. produces and sells cellulosic fibers in Portugal and internationally. The company offers bleached eucalyptus kraft pulp (BEKP) cellulose fibers for use in the manufacture of paper for household, printing, and writing purposes; and dissolved wood pulp (DWP) soluble cellulose fibers for use in the production of man-made cellulose fibers, such as lyocell and viscose for the textile sector. It is also involved in the timber and biomass commercialization; forest management; plant production in nurseries and services related to forests and landscapes; real estate; logistics services; research and development activities; and production and commercialization of cellulosic filaments. Altri, SGPS, S.A. was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Porto, Portugal.","exchange":"Lisbon","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Altri, SGPS, S.A. produit et vend des fibres cellulosiques au Portugal et à l’international. La société propose des fibres de cellulose de pâte kraft d'eucalyptus blanchi (BEKP) destinées à la fabrication de papier à usage domestique, d'impression et d'écriture; et des fibres de cellulose solubles de pâte de bois dissoute (DWP) destinées à la production de fibres de cellulose artificielles, telles que la lyocell et la viscose pour le secteur textile. Il est également impliqué dans la commercialisation du bois et de la biomasse; la gestion des forêts; la production végétale dans les pépinières et les services liés aux forêts et aux paysages; l'immobilier; les services logistiques; les activités de recherche et développement;